usage: uw rocoto validate [-h] [--version] [--config-file PATH]
                          [--key-path KEY[.KEY...]] [--quiet] [--verbose]

Validate a Rocoto YAML config

Optional arguments:
  -h, --help
      Show help and exit
  --version
      Show version info and exit
  --config-file PATH, -c PATH
      Path to UW YAML config file (default: read from stdin)
  --key-path KEY[.KEY...]
      Dot-separated path to mapping containing Rocoto block
  --quiet, -q
      Print no logging messages
  --verbose, -v
      Print all logging messages
